{"version":2,"surah":74,"verses":[{"n":1,"key":"74:1","arabic":" يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلْمُدَّثِّرُ","page":575,"juz":29,"en":"O you who covers himself [with a garment],","id":"Wahai orang yang berkemul (berselimut)!","latinEn":"Ya ayyuha almuddaththir","latinId":"Yā ayyuhal-muddaṡṡir(u).","words":[{"a":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en":"O you","id":"O you","t":"yāayyuhā"},{"a":"ٱلْمُدَّثِّرُ","en":"who covers himself","id":"who covers himself","t":"l-mudathiru"}]},{"n":2,"key":"74:2","arabic":"قُمْ فَأَنذِرْ","page":575,"juz":29,"en":"Arise and warn.","id":"bangunlah, lalu berilah peringatan!","latinEn":"Qum faanthir","latinId":"Qum fa'anżir.","words":[{"a":"قُمْ","en":"Stand up","id":"Stand up","t":"qum"},{"a":"فَأَنذِرْ","en":"and warn","id":"and warn","t":"fa-andhir"}]},{"n":3,"key":"74:3","arabic":"وَرَبَّكَ فَكَبِّرْ","page":575,"juz":29,"en":"And your Lord glorify.","id":"dan agungkanlah Tuhanmu,","latinEn":"Warabbaka fakabbir","latinId":"Wa rabbaka fakabbir.","words":[{"a":"وَرَبَّكَ","en":"And your Lord","id":"And your Lord","t":"warabbaka"},{"a":"فَكَبِّرْ","en":"magnify","id":"magnify","t":"fakabbir"}]},{"n":4,"key":"74:4","arabic":"وَثِيَابَكَ فَطَهِّرْ","page":575,"juz":29,"en":"And your clothing purify.","id":"dan bersihkanlah pakaianmu,","latinEn":"Wathiyabaka fatahhir","latinId":"Wa ṡiyābaka faṭahhir.","words":[{"a":"وَثِيَابَكَ","en":"And your clothing","id":"And your clothing","t":"wathiyābaka"},{"a":"فَطَهِّرْ","en":"purify","id":"purify","t":"faṭahhir"}]},{"n":5,"key":"74:5","arabic":"وَٱلرُّجْزَ فَٱهْجُرْ","page":575,"juz":29,"en":"And uncleanliness avoid.","id":"dan tinggalkanlah segala (perbuatan) yang keji,","latinEn":"Warrujza fahjur","latinId":"War-rujza fahjur.","words":[{"a":"وَٱلرُّجْزَ","en":"And uncleanliness","id":"And uncleanliness","t":"wal-ruj'za"},{"a":"فَٱهْجُرْ","en":"avoid","id":"avoid","t":"fa-uh'jur"}]},{"n":6,"key":"74:6","arabic":"وَلَا تَمْنُن تَسْتَكْثِرُ","page":575,"juz":29,"en":"And do not confer favor to acquire more.","id":"dan janganlah engkau (Muhammad) memberi (dengan maksud) memperoleh (balasan) yang lebih banyak.","latinEn":"Wala tamnun tastakthir","latinId":"Wa lā tamnun tastakṡir(u).","words":[{"a":"وَلَا","en":"And (do) not","id":"And (do) not","t":"walā"},{"a":"تَمْنُن","en":"confer favor","id":"confer favor","t":"tamnun"},{"a":"تَسْتَكْثِرُ","en":"(to) acquire more","id":"(to) acquire more","t":"tastakthiru"}]},{"n":7,"key":"74:7","arabic":"وَلِرَبِّكَ فَٱصْبِرْ","page":575,"juz":29,"en":"But for your Lord be patient.","id":"Dan karena Tuhanmu, bersabarlah.","latinEn":"Walirabbika fasbir","latinId":"Wa lirabbika faṣbir.","words":[{"a":"وَلِرَبِّكَ","en":"And for your Lord","id":"And for your Lord","t":"walirabbika"},{"a":"فَٱصْبِرْ","en":"be patient","id":"be patient","t":"fa-iṣ'bir"}]},{"n":8,"key":"74:8","arabic":"فَإِذَا نُقِرَ فِى ٱلنَّاقُورِ","page":575,"juz":29,"en":"And when the trumpet is blown,","id":"Maka apabila sangkakala ditiup,","latinEn":"Fa-itha nuqira fee annaqoor","latinId":"Fa iżā nuqira fin-nāqūr(i).","words":[{"a":"فَإِذَا","en":"Then when","id":"Then when","t":"fa-idhā"},{"a":"نُقِرَ","en":"is blown","id":"is blown","t":"nuqira"},{"a":"فِى","en":"in","id":"in","t":"fī"},{"a":"ٱلنَّاقُورِ","en":"the trumpet","id":"the trumpet","t":"l-nāqūri"}]},{"n":9,"key":"74:9","arabic":"فَذَٰلِكَ يَوْمَئِذٍ يَوْمٌ عَسِيرٌ","page":575,"juz":29,"en":"That Day will be a difficult day","id":"maka itulah hari yang serba sulit,","latinEn":"Fathalika yawma-ithin yawmunAAaseer","latinId":"Fa żālika yauma'iżiy yaumun ‘asīr(un).","words":[{"a":"فَذَٰلِكَ","en":"That","id":"That","t":"fadhālika"},{"a":"يَوْمَئِذٍۢ","en":"Day","id":"Day","t":"yawma-idhin"},{"a":"يَوْمٌ","en":"(will be) a Day","id":"(will be) a Day","t":"yawmun"},{"a":"عَسِيرٌ","en":"difficult","id":"difficult","t":"ʿasīrun"}]},{"n":10,"key":"74:10","arabic":"عَلَى ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ غَيْرُ يَسِيرٍ","page":575,"juz":29,"en":"For the disbelievers - not easy.","id":"bagi orang-orang kafir tidak mudah.","latinEn":"AAala alkafireena ghayruyaseer","latinId":"‘Alal-kāfirīna gairu yasīr(in).","words":[{"a":"عَلَى","en":"For","id":"For","t":"ʿalā"},{"a":"ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","en":"the disbelievers","id":"the disbelievers","t":"l-kāfirīna"},{"a":"غَيْرُ","en":"not","id":"not","t":"ghayru"},{"a":"يَسِيرٍۢ","en":"easy","id":"easy","t":"yasīrin"}]},{"n":11,"key":"74:11","arabic":"ذَرْنِى وَمَنْ خَلَقْتُ وَحِيدًا","page":575,"juz":29,"en":"Leave Me with the one I created alone","id":"Biarkanlah Aku (yang bertindak) terhadap orang yang Aku sendiri telah menciptakannya,","latinEn":"Tharnee waman khalaqtu waheeda","latinId":"Żarnī wa man khalaqtu waḥīdā(n).","words":[{"a":"ذَرْنِى","en":"Leave Me","id":"Leave Me","t":"dharnī"},{"a":"وَمَنْ","en":"and whom","id":"and whom","t":"waman"},{"a":"خَلَقْتُ","en":"I created","id":"I created","t":"khalaqtu"},{"a":"وَحِيدًۭا","en":"alone","id":"alone","t":"waḥīdan"}]},{"n":12,"key":"74:12","arabic":"وَجَعَلْتُ لَهُۥ مَالًا مَّمْدُودًا","page":575,"juz":29,"en":"And to whom I granted extensive wealth","id":"dan Aku berikan baginya kekayaan yang melimpah,","latinEn":"WajaAAaltu lahu malan mamdooda","latinId":"Wa ja‘altu lahū mālam mamdūdā(n).","words":[{"a":"وَجَعَلْتُ","en":"And I granted","id":"And I granted","t":"wajaʿaltu"},{"a":"لَهُۥ","en":"to him","id":"to him","t":"lahu"},{"a":"مَالًۭا","en":"wealth","id":"wealth","t":"mālan"},{"a":"مَّمْدُودًۭا","en":"extensive","id":"extensive","t":"mamdūdan"}]},{"n":13,"key":"74:13","arabic":"وَبَنِينَ شُهُودًا","page":575,"juz":29,"en":"And children present [with him]","id":"dan anak-anak yang selalu bersamanya,","latinEn":"Wabaneena shuhooda","latinId":"Wa banīna syuhūdā(n).","words":[{"a":"وَبَنِينَ","en":"And children","id":"And children","t":"wabanīna"},{"a":"شُهُودًۭا","en":"present","id":"present","t":"shuhūdan"}]},{"n":14,"key":"74:14","arabic":"وَمَهَّدتُّ لَهُۥ تَمْهِيدًا","page":575,"juz":29,"en":"And spread [everything] before him, easing [his life].","id":"dan Aku berikan baginya kelapangan (hidup) seluas-luasnya.","latinEn":"Wamahhadtu lahu tamheeda","latinId":"Wa mahhattu lahū tamhīdā(n).","words":[{"a":"وَمَهَّدتُّ","en":"And I spread","id":"And I spread","t":"wamahhadttu"},{"a":"لَهُۥ","en":"for him","id":"for him","t":"lahu"},{"a":"تَمْهِيدًۭا","en":"ease","id":"ease","t":"tamhīdan"}]},{"n":15,"key":"74:15","arabic":"ثُمَّ يَطْمَعُ أَنْ أَزِيدَ","page":575,"juz":29,"en":"Then he desires that I should add more.","id":"kemudian dia ingin sekali agar Aku menambahnya.","latinEn":"Thumma yatmaAAu an azeed","latinId":"Ṡumma yaṭma‘u an azīd(a).","words":[{"a":"ثُمَّ","en":"Then","id":"Then","t":"thumma"},{"a":"يَطْمَعُ","en":"he desires","id":"he desires","t":"yaṭmaʿu"},{"a":"أَنْ","en":"that","id":"that","t":"an"},{"a":"أَزِيدَ","en":"I (should) add more","id":"I (should) add more","t":"azīda"}]},{"n":16,"key":"74:16","arabic":"كَلَّآ ۖ إِنَّهُۥ كَانَ لِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا عَنِيدًا","page":575,"juz":29,"en":"No! Indeed, he has been toward Our verses obstinate.","id":"Tidak bisa! Sesungguhnya dia telah menentang ayat-ayat Kami (Alquran).","latinEn":"Kalla innahu kana li-ayatinaAAaneeda","latinId":"Kallā, innahū kāna li'āyātinā ‘anīdā(n).","words":[{"a":"كَلَّآ ۖ","en":"By no means","id":"By no means","t":"kallā"},{"a":"إِنَّهُۥ","en":"Indeed, he","id":"Indeed, he","t":"innahu"},{"a":"كَانَ","en":"has been","id":"has been","t":"kāna"},{"a":"لِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا","en":"to Our Verses","id":"to Our Verses","t":"liāyātinā"},{"a":"عَنِيدًۭا","en":"stubborn","id":"stubborn","t":"ʿanīdan"}]},{"n":17,"key":"74:17","arabic":"سَأُرْهِقُهُۥ صَعُودًا","page":575,"juz":29,"en":"I will cover him with arduous torment.","id":"Aku akan membebaninya dengan pendakian yang meletihkan.","latinEn":"Saorhiquhu saAAooda","latinId":"Sa'urhiquhū ṣa‘ūdā(n).","words":[{"a":"سَأُرْهِقُهُۥ","en":"Soon I will cover Him","id":"Soon I will cover Him","t":"sa-ur'hiquhu"},{"a":"صَعُودًا","en":"(with) a laborious punishment","id":"(with) a laborious punishment","t":"ṣaʿūdan"}]},{"n":18,"key":"74:18","arabic":"إِنَّهُۥ فَكَّرَ وَقَدَّرَ","page":575,"juz":29,"en":"Indeed, he thought and deliberated.","id":"Sesungguhnya dia telah memikirkan dan menetapkan (apa yang ditetapkannya),","latinEn":"Innahu fakkara waqaddar","latinId":"Innahū fakkara wa qaddar(a).","words":[{"a":"إِنَّهُۥ","en":"Indeed, he","id":"Indeed, he","t":"innahu"},{"a":"فَكَّرَ","en":"thought","id":"thought","t":"fakkara"},{"a":"وَقَدَّرَ","en":"and plotted","id":"and plotted","t":"waqaddara"}]},{"n":19,"key":"74:19","arabic":"فَقُتِلَ كَيْفَ قَدَّرَ","page":576,"juz":29,"en":"So may he be destroyed [for] how he deliberated.","id":"maka celakalah dia! Bagaimana dia menetapkan?","latinEn":"Faqutila kayfa qaddar","latinId":"Faqutila kaifa qaddar(a).","words":[{"a":"فَقُتِلَ","en":"So may he be destroyed","id":"So may he be destroyed","t":"faqutila"},{"a":"كَيْفَ","en":"how","id":"how","t":"kayfa"},{"a":"قَدَّرَ","en":"he plotted","id":"he plotted","t":"qaddara"}]},{"n":20,"key":"74:20","arabic":"ثُمَّ قُتِلَ كَيْفَ قَدَّرَ","page":576,"juz":29,"en":"Then may he be destroyed [for] how he deliberated.","id":"sekali lagi, celakalah dia! Bagaimana dia menetapkan?","latinEn":"Thumma qutila kayfa qaddar","latinId":"Ṡumma qutila kaifa qaddar(a).","words":[{"a":"ثُمَّ","en":"Then","id":"Then","t":"thumma"},{"a":"قُتِلَ","en":"may he be destroyed","id":"may he be destroyed","t":"qutila"},{"a":"كَيْفَ","en":"how","id":"how","t":"kayfa"},{"a":"قَدَّرَ","en":"he plotted","id":"he plotted","t":"qaddara"}]},{"n":21,"key":"74:21","arabic":"ثُمَّ نَظَرَ","page":576,"juz":29,"en":"Then he considered [again];","id":"kemudian dia (merenung) memikirkan,","latinEn":"Thumma nathar","latinId":"Ṡumma naẓar(a).","words":[{"a":"ثُمَّ","en":"Then","id":"Then","t":"thumma"},{"a":"نَظَرَ","en":"he looked","id":"he looked","t":"naẓara"}]},{"n":22,"key":"74:22","arabic":"ثُمَّ عَبَسَ وَبَسَرَ","page":576,"juz":29,"en":"Then he frowned and scowled;","id":"lalu berwajah masam dan cemberut,","latinEn":"Thumma AAabasa wabasar","latinId":"Ṡumma ‘abasa wa basar(a).","words":[{"a":"ثُمَّ","en":"Then","id":"Then","t":"thumma"},{"a":"عَبَسَ","en":"he frowned","id":"he frowned","t":"ʿabasa"},{"a":"وَبَسَرَ","en":"and scowled","id":"and scowled","t":"wabasara"}]},{"n":23,"key":"74:23","arabic":"ثُمَّ أَدْبَرَ وَٱسْتَكْبَرَ","page":576,"juz":29,"en":"Then he turned back and was arrogant","id":"kemudian berpaling (dari kebenaran) dan menyombongkan diri,","latinEn":"Thumma adbara wastakbar","latinId":"Ṡumma adbara wastakbar(a).","words":[{"a":"ثُمَّ","en":"Then","id":"Then","t":"thumma"},{"a":"أَدْبَرَ","en":"he turned back","id":"he turned back","t":"adbara"},{"a":"وَٱسْتَكْبَرَ","en":"and was proud","id":"and was proud","t":"wa-is'takbara"}]},{"n":24,"key":"74:24","arabic":"فَقَالَ إِنْ هَـٰذَآ إِلَّا سِحْرٌ يُؤْثَرُ","page":576,"juz":29,"en":"And said, \"This is not but magic imitated [from others].","id":"lalu dia berkata, \"(Alquran) ini hanyalah sihir yang dipelajari (dari orang-orang dahulu).","latinEn":"Faqala in hatha illa sihrunyu/thar","latinId":"Faqāla in hāżā illā siḥruy yu'ṡar(u).","words":[{"a":"فَقَالَ","en":"Then he said","id":"Then he said","t":"faqāla"},{"a":"إِنْ","en":"Not","id":"Not","t":"in"},{"a":"هَـٰذَآ","en":"(is) this","id":"(is) this","t":"hādhā"},{"a":"إِلَّا","en":"but","id":"but","t":"illā"},{"a":"سِحْرٌۭ","en":"magic","id":"magic","t":"siḥ'run"},{"a":"يُؤْثَرُ","en":"imitated","id":"imitated","t":"yu'tharu"}]},{"n":25,"key":"74:25","arabic":"إِنْ هَـٰذَآ إِلَّا قَوْلُ ٱلْبَشَرِ","page":576,"juz":29,"en":"This is not but the word of a human being.\"","id":"Ini hanyalah perkataan manusia.\"","latinEn":"In hatha illa qawlu albashar","latinId":"In hāżā illā qaulul-basyar(i).","words":[{"a":"إِنْ","en":"Not","id":"Not","t":"in"},{"a":"هَـٰذَآ","en":"(is) this","id":"(is) this","t":"hādhā"},{"a":"إِلَّا","en":"but","id":"but","t":"illā"},{"a":"قَوْلُ","en":"(the) word","id":"(the) word","t":"qawlu"},{"a":"ٱلْبَشَرِ","en":"(of) a human being","id":"(of) a human being","t":"l-bashari"}]},{"n":26,"key":"74:26","arabic":"سَأُصْلِيهِ سَقَرَ","page":576,"juz":29,"en":"I will drive him into Saqar.","id":"Kelak, Aku akan memasukkannya ke dalam (neraka) Saqar,","latinEn":"Saosleehi saqar","latinId":"Sa'uṣlīhi saqar(a).","words":[{"a":"سَأُصْلِيهِ","en":"Soon I will drive him","id":"Soon I will drive him","t":"sa-uṣ'līhi"},{"a":"سَقَرَ","en":"(into) Hell","id":"(into) Hell","t":"saqara"}]},{"n":27,"key":"74:27","arabic":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا سَقَرُ","page":576,"juz":29,"en":"And what can make you know what is Saqar?","id":"Dan tahukah kamu apa (neraka) Saqar itu?","latinEn":"Wama adraka ma saqar","latinId":"Wa mā adrāka mā saqar(a).","words":[{"a":"وَمَآ","en":"And what","id":"And what","t":"wamā"},{"a":"أَدْرَىٰكَ","en":"can make you know","id":"can make you know","t":"adrāka"},{"a":"مَا","en":"what","id":"what","t":"mā"},{"a":"سَقَرُ","en":"(is) Hell","id":"(is) Hell","t":"saqaru"}]},{"n":28,"key":"74:28","arabic":"لَا تُبْقِى وَلَا تَذَرُ","page":576,"juz":29,"en":"It lets nothing remain and leaves nothing [unburned],","id":"Ia (Saqar itu) tidak meninggalkan dan tidak membiarkan,","latinEn":"La tubqee wala tathar","latinId":"Lā tubqī wa lā tażar(u).","words":[{"a":"لَا","en":"Not","id":"Not","t":"lā"},{"a":"تُبْقِى","en":"it lets remain","id":"it lets remain","t":"tub'qī"},{"a":"وَلَا","en":"and not","id":"and not","t":"walā"},{"a":"تَذَرُ","en":"it leaves","id":"it leaves","t":"tadharu"}]},{"n":29,"key":"74:29","arabic":"لَوَّاحَةٌ لِّلْبَشَرِ","page":576,"juz":29,"en":"Altering [i.e., blackening] the skins.","id":"yang menghanguskan kulit manusia.","latinEn":"Lawwahatun lilbashar","latinId":"Lawwāḥatul lil-basyar(i).","words":[{"a":"لَوَّاحَةٌۭ","en":"Scorching","id":"Scorching","t":"lawwāḥatun"},{"a":"لِّلْبَشَرِ","en":"the human (skin)","id":"the human (skin)","t":"lil'bashari"}]},{"n":30,"key":"74:30","arabic":"عَلَيْهَا تِسْعَةَ عَشَرَ","page":576,"juz":29,"en":"Over it are nineteen [angels].","id":"Di atasnya ada sembilan belas (malaikat penjaga).","latinEn":"AAalayha tisAAata AAashar","latinId":"‘Alaihā tis‘ata ‘asyar(a).","words":[{"a":"عَلَيْهَا","en":"Over it","id":"Over it","t":"ʿalayhā"},{"a":"تِسْعَةَ","en":"(are) nine","id":"(are) nine","t":"tis'ʿata"},{"a":"عَشَرَ","en":"teen","id":"teen","t":"ʿashara"}]},{"n":31,"key":"74:31","arabic":"وَمَا جَعَلْنَآ أَصْحَـٰبَ ٱلنَّارِ إِلَّا مَلَـٰٓئِكَةً ۙ وَمَا جَعَلْنَا عِدَّتَهُمْ إِلَّا فِتْنَةً لِّلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ لِيَسْتَيْقِنَ ٱلَّذِينَ أُوتُوا۟ ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ وَيَزْدَادَ ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوٓا۟ إِيمَـٰنًا ۙ وَلَا يَرْتَابَ ٱلَّذِينَ أُوتُوا۟ ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ وَٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ ۙ وَلِيَقُولَ ٱلَّذِينَ فِى قُلُوبِهِم مَّرَضٌ وَٱلْكَـٰفِرُونَ مَاذَآ أَرَادَ ٱللَّهُ بِهَـٰذَا مَثَلًا ۚ كَذَٰلِكَ يُضِلُّ ٱللَّهُ مَن يَشَآءُ وَيَهْدِى مَن يَشَآءُ ۚ وَمَا يَعْلَمُ جُنُودَ رَبِّكَ إِلَّا هُوَ ۚ وَمَا هِىَ إِلَّا ذِكْرَىٰ لِلْبَشَرِ","page":576,"juz":29,"en":"And We have not made the keepers of the Fire except angels. And We have not made their number except as a trial for those who disbelieve - that those who were given the Scripture will be convinced and those who have believed will increase in faith and those who were given the Scripture and the believers will not doubt and that those in whose hearts is disease [i.e., hypocrisy] and the disbelievers will say, \"What does Allāh intend by this as an example?\" Thus does Allāh send astray whom He wills and guide whom He wills. And none knows the soldiers of your Lord except Him. And it [i.e., mention of the Fire] is not but a reminder to humanity.","id":"Dan yang Kami jadikan penjaga neraka itu hanya dari malaikat; dan Kami menentukan bilangan mereka itu hanya sebagai cobaan bagi orang-orang kafir, agar orang-orang yang diberi kitab menjadi yakin, agar orang yang beriman bertambah imannya, agar orang-orang yang diberi kitab dan orang-orang mukmin itu tidak ragu-ragu; dan agar orang-orang yang di dalam hatinya ada penyakit dan orang-orang kafir (berkata), \"Apakah yang dikehendaki Allah dengan (bilangan) ini sebagai suatu perumpamaan?\" Demikianlah Allah membiarkan sesat orang-orang yang Dia kehendaki dan memberi petunjuk kepada orang-orang yang Dia kehendaki. Dan tidak ada yang mengetahui bala tentara Tuhanmu kecuali Dia sendiri. Dan Saqar itu tidak lain hanyalah peringatan bagi manusia.","latinEn":"Wama jaAAalna as-habaannari illa mala-ikatan wamajaAAalna AAiddatahum illa fitnatan lillatheenakafaroo liyastayqina allatheena ootoo alkitabawayazdada allatheena amanoo eemananwala yartaba allatheena ootoo alkitabawalmu/minoona waliyaqoola allatheena feequloobihim maradun walkafiroona mathaarada Allahu bihatha mathalan kathalikayudillu Allahu man yashao wayahdee man yashaowama yaAAlamu junooda rabbika illa huwa wamahiya illa thikra lilbashar","latinId":"Wa mā ja‘alnā aṣḥāban-nāri illā malā'ikah(tan), wa mā ja‘alnā ‘iddatahum illā fitnatal lil-lażīna kafarū, liyastaiqinal-lażīna ūtul-kitāba wa yazdādal-lażīna āmanū īmānaw wa lā yartābal-lażīna ūtul-kitāba wal-mu'minūn(a), wa liyaqūlal-lażīna fī qulūbihim maraḍuw wal-kāfirūna māżā arādallāhu bihāżā maṡalā(n), każālika yuḍillullāhu may yasyā'u wa yahdī may yasyā'(u), wa mā ya‘lamu junūda rabbika illā huw(a), wa mā hiya illā żikrā lil-basyar(i).","words":[{"a":"وَمَا","en":"And not","id":"And not","t":"wamā"},{"a":"جَعَلْنَآ","en":"We have made","id":"We have made","t":"jaʿalnā"},{"a":"أَصْحَـٰبَ","en":"keepers","id":"keepers","t":"aṣḥāba"},{"a":"ٱلنَّارِ","en":"(of) the Fire","id":"(of) the Fire","t":"l-nāri"},{"a":"إِلَّا","en":"except","id":"except","t":"illā"},{"a":"مَلَـٰٓئِكَةًۭ ۙ","en":"Angels","id":"Angels","t":"malāikatan"},{"a":"وَمَا","en":"And not","id":"And not","t":"wamā"},{"a":"جَعَلْنَا","en":"We have made","id":"We have made","t":"jaʿalnā"},{"a":"عِدَّتَهُمْ","en":"their number","id":"their number","t":"ʿiddatahum"},{"a":"إِلَّا","en":"except","id":"except","t":"illā"},{"a":"فِتْنَةًۭ","en":"(as) a trial","id":"(as) a trial","t":"fit'natan"},{"a":"لِّلَّذِينَ","en":"for those who","id":"for those who","t":"lilladhīna"},{"a":"كَف