it has earned, will be retained.","id":"Setiap orang bertanggung jawab atas apa yang telah dilakukannya,","latinEn":"Kullu nafsin bima kasabat raheena","latinId":"Kullu nafsim bimā kasabat rahīnah(tun).","words":[{"a":"كُلُّ","en":"Every","id":"Every","t":"kullu"},{"a":"نَفْسٍۭ","en":"soul","id":"soul","t":"nafsin"},{"a":"بِمَا","en":"for what","id":"for what","t":"bimā"},{"a":"كَسَبَتْ","en":"it has earned","id":"it has earned","t":"kasabat"},{"a":"رَهِينَةٌ","en":"(is) pledged","id":"(is) pledged","t":"rahīnatun"}]},{"n":39,"key":"74:39","arabic":"إِلَّآ أَصْحَـٰبَ ٱلْيَمِينِ","page":576,"juz":29,"en":"Except the companions of the right,.","id":"kecuali golongan kanan,","latinEn":"Illa as-haba alyameen","latinId":"Illā aṣḥābal-yamīn(i).","words":[{"a":"إِلَّآ","en":"Except","id":"Except","t":"illā"},{"a":"أَصْحَـٰبَ","en":"(the) companions","id":"(the) companions","t":"aṣḥāba"},{"a":"ٱلْيَمِينِ","en":"(of) the right","id":"(of) the right","t":"l-yamīni"}]},{"n":40,"key":"74:40","arabic":"فِى جَنَّـٰتٍ يَتَسَآءَلُونَ","page":576,"juz":29,"en":"[Who will be] in gardens, questioning each other","id":"berada di dalam surga, mereka saling menanyakan,","latinEn":"Fee jannatin yatasaaloon","latinId":"Fī jannātin - yatasā'alūn(a).","words":[{"a":"فِى","en":"In","id":"In","t":"fī"},{"a":"جَنَّـٰتٍۢ","en":"Gardens","id":"Gardens","t":"jannātin"},{"a":"يَتَسَآءَلُونَ","en":"asking each other","id":"asking each other","t":"yatasāalūna"}]},{"n":41,"key":"74:41","arabic":"عَنِ ٱلْمُجْرِمِينَ","page":576,"juz":29,"en":"About the criminals,","id":"tentang (keadaan) orang-orang yang berdosa,","latinEn":"AAani almujrimeen","latinId":"‘Anil-mujrimīn(a).","words":[{"a":"عَنِ","en":"About","id":"About","t":"ʿani"},{"a":"ٱلْمُجْرِمِينَ","en":"the criminals","id":"the criminals","t":"l-muj'rimīna"}]},{"n":42,"key":"74:42","arabic":"مَا سَلَكَكُمْ فِى سَقَرَ","page":576,"juz":29,"en":"[And asking them], \"What put you into Saqar?\"","id":"\"Apa yang menyebabkan kamu masuk ke dalam (n