:"Then what is [the matter] with them that they are, from the reminder, turning away.","id":"Lalu mengapa mereka (orang-orang kafir) berpaling dari peringatan (Allah)?","latinEn":"Fama lahum AAani attathkiratimuAArideen","latinId":"Famā lahum ‘anit-tażkirati mu‘riḍīn(a).","words":[{"a":"فَمَا","en":"Then what","id":"Then what","t":"famā"},{"a":"لَهُمْ","en":"(is) for them","id":"(is) for them","t":"lahum"},{"a":"عَنِ","en":"(that) from","id":"(that) from","t":"ʿani"},{"a":"ٱلتَّذْكِرَةِ","en":"the Reminder","id":"the Reminder","t":"l-tadhkirati"},{"a":"مُعْرِضِينَ","en":"they (are) turning away","id":"they (are) turning away","t":"muʿ'riḍīna"}]},{"n":50,"key":"74:50","arabic":"كَأَنَّهُمْ حُمُرٌ مُّسْتَنفِرَةٌ","page":577,"juz":29,"en":"As if they were alarmed donkeys.","id":"seakan-akan mereka keledai liar yang lari terkejut,","latinEn":"Kaannahum humurun mustanfira","latinId":"Ka'annahum ḥumurum mustanfirah(tun).","words":[{"a":"كَأَنَّهُمْ","en":"As if they (were)","id":"As if they (were)","t":"ka-annahum"},{"a":"حُمُرٌۭ","en":"donkeys","id":"donkeys","t":"ḥumurun"},{"a":"مُّسْتَنفِرَةٌۭ","en":"frightened","id":"frightened","t":"mus'tanfiratun"}]},{"n":51,"key":"74:51","arabic":"فَرَّتْ مِن قَسْوَرَةٍۭ","page":577,"juz":29,"en":"Fleeing from a lion?","id":"lari dari singa.","latinEn":"Farrat min qaswara","latinId":"Farrat min qaswarah(tin).","words":[{"a":"فَرَّتْ","en":"Fleeing","id":"Fleeing","t":"farrat"},{"a":"مِن","en":"from","id":"from","t":"min"},{"a":"قَسْوَرَةٍۭ","en":"a lion","id":"a lion","t":"qaswaratin"}]},{"n":52,"key":"74:52","arabic":"بَلْ يُرِيدُ كُلُّ ٱمْرِئٍ مِّنْهُمْ أَن يُؤْتَىٰ صُحُفًا مُّنَشَّرَةً","page":577,"juz":29,"en":"Rather, every person among them desires that he would be given scriptures spread about.","id":"Bahkan setiap orang dari mereka ingin agar diberikan kepadanya lembaran-lembaran (kitab) yang terbuka.","latinEn":"Bal yureedu kullu imri-in minhum an yu/tasuhufan munashshara","latinId":"Bal yurīdu kullumri'im minhum ay yu'tā ṣuḥufam munasysyarah(tan).","words":[{"a":"بَلْ","en":"Nay","id":"Nay","t":"bal"},{"a":"يُرِيدُ","en":"Desires","id":"Desires","t":"yurīdu"},{"a":"كُلُّ","en":"every","id":"every","t":"kullu"},{"a":"ٱمْرِئٍۢ","en":"person","id":"person","t":"im'ri-in"},{"a":"مِّنْهُمْ","en":"of them","id":"of them","t":"min'hum"},{"a":"أَن","en":"that","id":"that","t":"an"},{"a":"يُؤْتَىٰ","en":"he may be given","id":"he may be given","t":"yu'tā"},{"a":"صُحُفًۭا","en":"pages","id":"pages","t":"ṣuḥufan"},{"a":"مُّنَشَّرَةًۭ","en":"spread out","id":"spread out","t":"munasharatan"}]},{"n":53,"key":"74:53","arabic":"كَلَّا ۖ بَل لَّا يَخَافُونَ ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةَ","page":577,"juz":29,"en":"No! But they do not fear the Hereafter.","id":"Tidak! Sebenarnya mereka tidak takut kepada akhirat.","latinEn":"Kalla bal la yakhafoonaal-akhira","latinId":"Kallā, bal lā yakhāfūnal-ākhirah(ta).","words":[{"a":"كَلَّا ۖ","en":"Nay","id":"Nay","t":"kallā"},{"a":"بَل","en":"But","id":"But","t":"bal"},{"a":"لَّا","en":"not","id":"not","t":"lā"},{"a":"يَخَافُونَ","en":"they fear","id":"they fear","t":"yakhāfūna"},{"a":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةَ","en":"the Hereafter","id":"the Hereafter","t":"l-ākhirata"}]},{"n":54,"key":"74:54","arabic":"كَلَّآ إِنَّهُۥ تَذْكِرَةٌ","page":577,"juz":29,"en":"No! Indeed, it [i.e., the Qur’ān] is a reminder.","id":"Tidak! Sesungguhnya (Alquran) itu benar-benar suatu peringatan.","latinEn":"Kalla innahu tathkira","latinId":"Kallā innahū tażkirah(tun).","words":[{"a":"كَلَّآ","en":"Nay","id":"Nay","t":"kallā"},{"a":"إِنَّهُۥ","en":"Indeed, it","id":"Indeed, it","t":"innahu"},{"a":"تَذْكِرَةٌۭ","en":"(is) a Reminder","id":"(is) a Reminder","t":"tadhkiratun"}]},{"n":55,"key":"74:55","arabic":"فَمَن شَآءَ ذَكَرَهُۥ","page":577,"juz":29,"en":"Then whoever wills will remember it.","id":"Maka barangsiapa menghendaki, tentu dia mengambil pelajaran darinya.","latinEn":"Faman shaa thakarah","latinId":"Faman syā'a żakarah(ū).","words":[{"a":"فَمَن","en":"So whoever","id":"So whoever","t":"faman"},{"a":"شَآءَ","en":"wills","id":"wills","t":"shāa"},{"a":"ذَكَرَهُۥ","en":"(may) pay heed to it","id":"(may) pay heed to it","t":"dhakarahu"}]},{"n":56,"key":"74:56","arabic":"وَمَا يَذْكُرُونَ إِلَّآ أَن يَشَآءَ ٱللَّهُ ۚ هُوَ أَهْلُ ٱلتَّقْوَىٰ وَأَهْلُ ٱلْمَغْفِرَةِ","page":577,"juz":29,"en":"And they will not remember except that Allāh wills. He is worthy of fear and adequate for [granting] forgiveness.","id":"Dan mereka tidak akan mengambil pelajaran darinya (Alquran) kecuali (jika) Allah menghendakinya. Dialah Tuhan yang patut (kita) bertakwa kepada-Nya dan yang berhak memberi ampun.","latinEn":"Wama yathkuroona illaan yashaa Allahu huwa ahlu attaqwawaahlu almaghfirat","latinId":"Wa mā yażkurūna illā ay yasyā'allāh(u), huwa ahlut-taqwā wa ahlul-magfirah(ti).","words":[{"a":"وَمَا","en":"And not","id":"And not","t":"wamā"},{"a":"يَذْكُرُونَ","en":"will pay heed","id":"will pay heed","t":"yadhkurūna"},{"a":"إِلَّآ","en":"except","id":"except","t":"illā"},{"a":"أَن","en":"that","id":"that","t":"an"},{"a":"يَشَآءَ","en":"wills","id":"wills","t":"yashāa"},{"a":"ٱللَّهُ ۚ","en":"Allah","id":"Allah","t":"l-lahu"},{"a":"هُوَ","en":"He","id":"He","t":"huwa"},{"a":"أَهْلُ","en":"(is) worthy","id":"(is) worthy","t":"ahlu"},{"a":"ٱلتَّقْوَىٰ","en":"to be feared","id":"to be feared","t":"l-taqwā"},{"a":"وَأَهْلُ","en":"and worthy","id":"and worthy","t":"wa-ahlu"},{"a":"ٱلْمَغْفِرَةِ","en":"to forgive","id":"to forgive","t":"l-maghfirati"}]}]}